# AEGIS // SKELETON — Cline Rules

> **Precedence:** `.kiro/steering/zero-idle-constitution.md` → `docs/MILESTONES.md` → this file.
> Never loosen a rule here; only tighten. If a rule conflicts with the constitution, the
> constitution wins and this file must be corrected in the same change.
>
> **Scope:** this file governs every UI change in `frontend/index.html` and any future
> `frontend/` asset. It merges the imported SaaS design system with the repository's
> zero-mock, zero-idle and surgical-scope guardrails.

---

## 0. Imported sources (verified 2026-11-13)

